  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>Whenever you improve an ally’s attack roll using aid another, the bonus granted increases to +3. This increases by 1 per 10 ranks in the associated skill you possess. If you do, you allow the aided ally to ignore any shield bonuses or dodge bonuses (chosen when you aid) that the opponent is benefitting from for as long as the ally is benefitting from the aid.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Open Up (<em>Melee Tactics Toolbox</em>)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
